{"v":4,"catch":"你有能力接受危險並成為終極地牢冒險家嗎？","desc":"Dungeon Adventure 是一款遊戲，您在其中探索巨大的地牢，希望能活著出去，同時消滅所有敵人。 您可以在其中找到很多東西，從強大的敵人到一些最好的小工具和最酷的物品。 但請注意，您可能無法從那個地方出來。\n\n立即獲取 Dungeon Adventure，讓自己沉浸在最令人興奮和最有意義的遊戲體驗中！\n\n特徵\n• 探索大型地牢\n• 消滅所有敵人\n• 黑白圖形\n• 有趣、身臨其境的遊戲玩法\n• 無限重玩價值","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2021-11-04","genres":["街機","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/38e07e93d8921bd4a937b805b23453d0ebf58d94dd00e5c306c5e5a5f065b5b1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b330b4c50ee2c1bb12f70069f22b3d2e73fcf6c915b9225ae5494f7773169e76.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c82181540871e68b082c7a8f4965dc42487268c2ac1646cf422736c8cefdcfe3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/52a7b7d6f340fd605ecb1ae3a02108822aff92cfb9068c27f9006af8b1a1cd64.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3e6f6e7e74c2d846abbb3ab81e573e5e62afa436e38668104de1c708f8b11acf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6fae1008cab4b56ec9d791ed3028e14932ce97eca138512fcd53fdaae4dab1fb.jpg"],"titleId":"0100610016c82000","dlc":[]}